%
O05000 (STAND-IN FOR A LOGGED AIR CUT: 4 X 3 IN RECTANGLE, 0.001 IN STEP-DOWN PER LAP)
(LAP ORDER, Z STEPS AND FEEDS READ FROM THE LOG: X+, Y-, X-, Y+ AT F20 FOR 3 LAPS, THEN F10)
G20 G17 G40 G49 G80 G90 G94
T1 M06
G00 G90 G54 X-4. Y0. S2000 M03
G43 H1 Z0.1
#1 = 0
WHILE [#1 LT 8] DO1
#2 = -0.001 * #1
#3 = 20.
IF [#1 GE 3] THEN #3 = 10.
G01 Z#2 F#3
X0.
Y-3.
X-4.
Y0.
#1 = #1 + 1
END1
G00 Z1.
G28 G91 Z0.
G90
M30
%
